Displays currency pair exchange rate on your Plasma desktop. 

All exchange rates between currencies from European Central Bank exchange rate table are available:
https://www.ecb.europa.eu/stats/policy_and_exchange_rates/euro_reference_exchange_rates/html/index.en.html

When you click a line with exchange rate displayed a browser window opens and navigates to DuckDuckGo exchange rate page.

Exchange rates are downloaded from https://frankfurter.app/
"Rates update around 4PM CET every working day."

KDE store link:
https://store.kde.org/p/1239022
(This is a fork of Foreign currencies plasmoid by bravenec2nd: https://store.kde.org/p/1170603)

Hacking
